     "body": "<p>Would this mean I could:<br/>\ncurl <a href=\"http://fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin@localhost:8983/fedora/rest/myresource.html\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin@localhost:8983/fedora/rest/myresource.html</a></p>\n\n<p>instead of?<br/>\ncurl -H \"Accept: text/html\" <a href=\"http://fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin@localhost:8983/fedora/rest/myresource\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">http://fedoraAdmin:fedoraAdmin@localhost:8983/fedora/rest/myresource</a></p>\n\n<p>Because that would be great.</p>",
